{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>For they are a garland</b> — missing a kaf; it is from the domain of ילוה אישי, and its meaning: as the joining of a thing of grace, so are discipline and Torah beautiful upon your head." "<b>To your neck</b> — the regions around the throat are called גרגרות. Likewise על צוארי בנימין. Likewise the regions around the head: מראשותיו."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:20:41.376586832Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}